 "remarks": "Well-maintained townhouse in Stamford's Glenbrook neighborhood, set within the established Oak Tree Condominium community. Spanning three finished levels, this spacious two-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bath home offers an open and functional layout with newly refinished hardwood floors, generous living areas, in-unit laundry, and a private deck overlooking the garden setting. The finished lower level adds valuable flexibility with recreation and office space plus a full bath, while the upper-level features two generously sized bedrooms and excellent storage. With no residence above or below, the home combines the feel and functionality of townhouse living with the convenience of condominium ownership. Conveniently located near the Glenbrook train station, local transit, shopping, dining, parks, and downtown Stamford. Truly a compelling opportunity to enjoy generous space, everyday flexibility, and a polished move-in-ready setting.",
